                "loc": "2CH.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina wa myaka ĩmwe atheea kwa Aavu Samalia. Na Aavu amũaĩa malondũ na ng’ombe mbingĩ mũno, we na andũ ala maĩ nake, na amũingĩĩsya kũthi nake Lamothi‐ngileati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.2+1KI.22.3+1KI.22.4+1KI.22.5+1KI.22.6+1KI.22.7+1KI.22.8+1KI.22.9+1KI.22.10+1KI.22.11+1KI.22.12+1KI.22.13+1KI.22.14+1KI.22.15+1KI.22.16+1KI.22.17+1KI.22.18+1KI.22.19+1KI.22.20+1KI.22.21+1KI.22.22+1KI.22.23+1KI.22.24+1KI.22.25+1KI.22.26+1KI.22.27+1KI.22.28+1KI.22.29+1KI.22.30+1KI.22.31+1KI.22.32+1KI.22.33+1KI.22.34+1KI.22.35"
              },
