              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Aavu mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli amũkũlya Yeosavati mũsumbĩ wa Yuta, We nũũthi nakwa Lamothi‐ngileati? Na amũsũngĩa, Nyie no taku, na andũ makwa ta andũ maku; na tũkeethĩwa vamwe naku kaũnĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeosavati amwĩa mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli, Nĩngũkwĩsũva, amba ũkũlya ũndũ ndeto ya Yeova ĩnĩkwasya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli wombanisye athani, andũ maana ana, na amakũlya, Nĩtũũthi Lamothi‐ngileati kũkita, kana nĩeke? Na masya, Ambata; nũndũ Ngai akamĩnengane kw’okonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ, Yeosavati akũlya, Vati mwathani ũngĩ wa Yeova vaa tũmũkũlye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli amwĩa Yeosavati, Ve o mũndũ ũngĩ ũla wa kũtũkũlĩlya kwa Yeova; ĩndĩ nĩngũmũmena; nũndũ ndambathanĩaa ũseo o na ĩndĩĩ, ĩndĩ ũthũku mavinda onthe; nake nĩ Mikaia mwana wa Imila. Na Yeosavati asya, Mũsumbĩ ndakaneene ũu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli wamwĩtie mũnene wa kwake, na amwĩa, Mũlatye Mikaia mwana wa Imila mĩtũkĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli na Yeosavati mũsumbĩ wa Yuta mekalĩte kĩla ũmwe kĩvĩlanĩ kyake kya ũsumbĩ, mekĩĩte ngũa syoo ndasa, na mekalĩte vandũ ũtheĩni ũlikĩlonĩ mbingĩlonĩ ya Samalia; na athani onthe no mathanĩaa mbee woo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Nzetekia mwana wa Kenaana eeseũvĩsya mbya sya iaa na asya, Ũũ nĩw’o Yeova ũnũkwasya, Ukatindĩka Asilia na ii, mũvaka maminwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na athani onthe mathana ũu, makyasya, Ambata Lamothi‐ngileati, ũkaathimĩke; nũndũ Yeova akamĩnengane kw’okonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũtũmwa ũla waendie kũmwĩta Mikaia aneena nake, akĩmwĩa, Sisya, ndeto sya athani niũtavan’ya ũseo kwa mũsumbĩ na kanyw’a ũmwe: nĩngũkwĩsũva, kwondũ wa ũu ndeto yaku yĩthĩwe ĩilyĩ ta ĩmwe yoo, noineena ũseo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mikaia asya, O tondũ Yeova wĩ thayũ, o ũndũ Ngai wakwa wĩasya, now’o nĩneena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.24.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mot 24.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla wavikie vala ve mũsumbĩ, mũsumbĩ amũkũlya, Mikaia, nĩtũũthi Lamothi‐ngileati tũkite, kana nĩeke? Na amũsũngĩa, Ambatai mũkaathimĩke; na makanenganwe kw’okonĩ kwaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ amwĩa, Nĩtũa ngũavĩthasya mavinda meana ndũkandavye ũndũ ũte wa w’o syĩtwanĩ ya Yeova? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake asya, Nĩnonie Isilaeli onthe manyaĩĩkĩte iĩmanĩ, ta malondu mate mũĩthi: na Yeova asya, Aa mati na vwana; masyoke kĩla mũndũ nyũmbanĩ yake na mũuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli amwĩa Yeosavati, Ndinakũtavya ndakambathanĩa ũseo, ĩndĩ ũthũku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mikaia asya, Kwondũ wa ũu ĩw’ai ndeto ya Yeova: Nĩnonie Yeova ekalĩte kĩvĩlanĩ kyake kya ũsumbĩ, na nguthu yonthe ya ĩtunĩ ĩũngamĩte kw’okonĩ kwake kwa aũme na kw’okonĩ kwake kwa aka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova akũlya, Nũũ ũla wĩmũsengasenga Aavu mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli nĩ kana ambate avalũke ku Lamothi‐ngileati? Na ũmwe aneena akyasya ũũ, na ũngĩ akyasya ũũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwaumĩla veva, na waũngama mbee wa Yeova, na wasya, Ngamũsengasenga. Na Yeova ookũlya, Na kyaũ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naw’o wasya. Ngaumaala nĩthi, na ngeethĩwa veva wa ũvũngũ kanyw’anĩ wa athani make onthe. Nake asya, Ũkamũsengasenga, o na ũkamũkĩlya vinya: enda, wĩke ũu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yu ĩndĩ, sisya, Yeova nĩwĩkĩĩte veva wa ũvũngũ kanyw’anĩ wa athani aa maku; na Yeova nũneenete ũthũku ũndũ waku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ Nzetekia mwana wa Kenaana wathengeeie, na amũkũna Mikaia ĩkovi ĩtau, na akũlya, Veva wa Yeova aumanga kwakwa ata aneene naku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mikaia asya, Sisya, ũkoona mũthenya ũsu, yĩla wĩlika kasũmbanĩ ka nthinĩ wĩvithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli asya, Mũkwatei Mikaia, na mũimũtũnga kwa Amoni ngavana wa ndũa, na kwa Yoasi mwana wa mũsumbĩ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mũkyasya, Ũũ nĩw’o mũsumbĩ ũnũkwasya, Ĩkĩai mũndũ ũũ kolokolonĩ, na mũimũnenga kĩmũtũ kya thĩna na manzĩ ma thĩna, kũvika yĩla nĩsyoka na mũuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mikaia asya, Ethĩwa ũkasyoka nongi na mũuo, Yeova ndaneenete na kanyw’a wakwa. Na asya, Ĩw’ai, inyw’ĩ andũ, inyw’onthe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli na Yeosavati mũsumbĩ wa Yuta mambata Lamothi‐ngileati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli amwĩa Yeosavati, Nĩngwĩyũlan’ya, na kũlika kaũnĩ; ĩndĩ we, ĩkĩa ngũa syaku ndasa. Na ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli eeyũlan’ya; na malika kaũnĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ wa Silia aĩ aneaĩa makavuteni ma makasya make ma kaũ, akamea, Mũtikokite na ala anini kana ala anene, ate o mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla makavuteni ma makasya moonie Yeosavati, masya, Nĩ mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli. Kwondũ wa ũu meelelũka mokite nake: ĩndĩ Yeosavati akaya, na Yeova amũtethya; na Ngai atuma mauma vala ũĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla makavuteni ma makasya moonie kana ti mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli, meetulũla maeka kũmũatĩĩa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũndũ ũmwe akoota ũta wake na alũlũngĩlya mũsyĩ, na amũathĩla mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli mothalan’yonĩ ma mĩio ya kaũ: kwondũ wa ũu amwĩa mũingi wa ĩkasya, Thyũũa kw’oko kwaku, ũmbumbye nguthunĩ; nũndũ nĩ mũkite mũno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kaũ waingĩva mũthenya ũsu: ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli eetw’ĩĩka e ĩkasyanĩ yake okite na Asilia kũvika wĩoo; na ta syũa ĩkĩthũa akw’a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
